From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:17:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build: eliminate GCC 14 and 16 diagnostics

Move oversized production and test buffers to checked heap storage, prove array bounds before indexed access, make configuration guards match call sites, and construct tool paths without truncation. Preserve valid-input behavior while making warning-clean GCC 14 and GCC 16 builds possible across production, tools, and generated FATE targets.
